<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Been | Graphic Designer Portfolio</title>
    <style>
        /* --- RESET & BASIC STYLES --- */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* --- NAVBAR --- */
        header {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            width: 100%;
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            z-index: 1000;
        }

        .nav-container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: #111;
        }

        .nav-links {
            list-style: none;
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #555;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: #111;
        }

        /* --- HERO SECTION --- */
        .hero {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 120px auto 60px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 48px;
            color: #111;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #666;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* --- PORTFOLIO GRID --- */
        .portfolio {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto 80px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        .portfolio h2 {
            font-size: 28px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .portfolio-item {
            background-color: #fff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .portfolio-item:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .portfolio-item img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 250px;
            object-fit: cover;
            display: block;
        }

        .item-info {
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .item-info h3 {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            color: #111;
        }

        .item-info p {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #777;
        }

        /* --- CONTACT --- */
        .contact {
            background-color: #111;
            color: #fff;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 60px 20px;
        }

        .contact h2 {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .contact p {
            color: #aaa;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .btn-contact {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #fff;
            color: #111;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            border-radius: 25px;
            transition: background-color 0.3s;
        }

        .btn-contact:hover {
            background-color: #ddd;
        }

        footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #555;
        }

        /* --- RESPONSIVE --- */
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .hero h1 { font-size: 36px; }
            .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="nav-container">
            <div class="logo">BEEN.</div>
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="#">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="#work">Works</a></li>
                <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <h1>Halo, Saya Been.</h1>
        <p>Seorang Graphic Designer yang berfokus pada pembuatan identitas visual, ilustrasi digital, dan aset kreatif yang fungsional sekaligus estetik.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="portfolio" id="work">
        <h2>Karya Terbaru</h2>
        
        <div class="grid">
            <div class="portfolio-item">
                <img src="link-foto-karyamu1.jpg" alt="Desain Logo">
                <div class="item-info">
                    <h3>Brand Identity - Edik Pro</h3>
                    <p>Konsep logo modern dan minimalis untuk industri audio.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="portfolio-item">
                <img src="link-foto-karyamu2.jpg" alt="Desain Flyer">
                <div class="item-info">
                    <h3>Promotional Flyer</h3>
                    <p>Desain brosur digital kreatif untuk persewaan busana.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="portfolio-item">
                <img src="link-foto-karyamu3.jpg" alt="Vektor Ilustrasi">
                <div class="item-info">
                    <h3>Digital Illustration</h3>
                    <p>Eksplorasi gaya artwork halftone dots dan envelope distort.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="contact" id="contact">
        <h2>Tertarik Kerja Sama?</h2>
        <p>Mari diskusikan project hebat Anda berikutnya bersama saya.</p>
        <a href="mailto:emailkamu@gmail.com" class="btn-contact">Hubungi Via Email</a>
        
        <footer>
            <p>&copy; 2026 Been. All Rights Reserved.</p>
        </footer>
    </section>

</body>
</html>
